            "review_title": "Review at +84 Cafe",
            "review_text": "Jimin V\n1 contribution\n0\nArrogant service and overpriced\nJan 2023 • Couples\nThe products and service are overprices and the prices are only in US dollars on the menu and drink cards, to know the prices in Vietnamese Dong monnay you have to ask them to make the calculator machine count. First be sur they give you the real price in Dong. \nWe ask for a tea at 1:am before our nigth fligth and all the team membres was arrogants, lazy and unprofessionnal, espacially the ladie at the reception who didn't had a good beavior because we was tourists. There was no body eles in the ariport exept our fligth. 70.000dong the small tea (3$) oveerpriced for airport. \nVery Bad service. Bad expérience.\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2023",
