            "review_text": "naomi\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nRude and unwilling\nSep 2018 • Family\nThe staff is rude and impolite. I would give them half a star for price, food and beverage if i could. But otherwise it made me lose my appetite talking to the staff, I'm always cheerful with employees because i have personally worked as staff but after seeing attitudes from ppl older than myself, I'm just disappointed. Maybe I didn't speak english for them to be just simply nice to other people.\nRead more\nWritten September 16, 2018\nThe One\nDear Sir/Madam,\nFirst of all, thank you very much for your comment about our service\nWe would like to apologize for any inconveniences you experienced at +84 Cafe. We have received your comment and will try to improve quality of service in order to serve passengers better in the future. \nWe always hope to welcome you in next times.\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
